INSERT INTO profiles (user_id,age,gender,presentation,bio,occupation,district,weekend,social,image,photos) VALUES
(1,27,'woman','feminine','Usually planning a weekend trail before Friday arrives. Amateur film photographer, enthusiastic coffee taster, and a surprisingly terrible karaoke singer. I like conversations that wander, small jazz venues, and leaving a museum with more questions than answers.','Creative strategist','Sheung Wan','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/01.webp','["/profiles/01.webp","/profiles/01-2.webp","/profiles/01-3.webp"]'),
(2,28,'man','masculine','I keep a camera in my bag and a list of little jazz bars in my notes. Weekends start with a trail and end with a very good coffee. Tell me about the exhibition you are still thinking about.','Architect','Sheung Wan','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/02.webp','["/profiles/02.webp","/profiles/02-2.webp","/profiles/02-3.webp"]'),
(3,29,'man','masculine','My dumpling recipe is a work in progress, but my board game collection is alarmingly complete. Happiest cooking for friends, watching an odd little film, or finding a new co-op game. Looking for a teammate, in the kitchen and beyond.','Game designer','Sheung Wan','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/03.webp','["/profiles/03.webp","/profiles/03-2.webp","/profiles/03-3.webp"]'),
(4,27,'woman','feminine','A sketchbook comes everywhere with me, including places where drawing is wildly impractical. I design small things for a living and cook enormous meals for friends. Would happily trade a gallery recommendation for your best rainy-day recipe.','Product designer','Causeway Bay','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/04.webp','["/profiles/04.webp"]'),
(5,34,'woman','feminine','My favourite running route ends at a bakery, which feels like a reasonable training philosophy. Between work and weekend films, I am learning to grow herbs on a very small balcony. The basil currently has the upper hand.','Financial analyst','Kennedy Town','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/05.webp','["/profiles/05.webp"]'),
(6,26,'woman','feminine','I teach science and occasionally lose an entire evening to a mystery novel. On Sundays I take the long ferry route just to watch the harbour. Bring a book recommendation; I will bring something homemade and probably too sweet.','Science teacher','Sai Ying Pun','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/06.webp','["/profiles/06.webp"]'),
(7,33,'woman','feminine','Bouldering has taught me patience, mostly because I spend so much time on the mat. Away from the climbing wall, I play piano and try unfamiliar recipes. An excellent first date involves laughing at something neither of us expected.','Physiotherapist','Mong Kok','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/07.webp','["/profiles/07.webp"]'),
(8,25,'woman','feminine','I collect cinema tickets and strong opinions about noodle texture. My work involves spreadsheets, but my weekends rarely follow a plan. Recently learned to mend clothes and am taking unreasonable pride in a slightly crooked jacket pocket.','Operations analyst','Tsim Sha Tsui','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/08.webp','["/profiles/08.webp"]'),
(9,32,'woman','feminine','There is usually a half-finished painting drying somewhere in my flat. I enjoy early swims, late films, and cooking with whoever happens to be around. I would love to meet someone curious about ordinary things.','Illustrator','Sha Tin','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/09.webp','["/profiles/09.webp"]'),
(10,24,'woman','feminine','My friends appoint me picnic organiser because I remember the blanket. I work with books, take dance classes, and photograph buildings nobody else notices. Looking for someone who will take a detour just because the street looks interesting.','Bookseller','Tsuen Wan','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/10.webp','["/profiles/10.webp"]'),
(11,31,'nonbinary','feminine','I make maps for work and take wrong turns for fun. A quiet afternoon might include a puzzle, an ambitious soup, and a very loud album. I like people who can disagree kindly and recommend a good walk.','Cartographer','Tseung Kwan O','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/11.webp','["/profiles/11.webp"]'),
(12,23,'woman','feminine','Currently learning guitar at a speed my neighbours probably appreciate. I spend the rest of my time designing, swimming, and finding tiny restaurants with enormous menus. I am equally enthusiastic about a dance floor and an early night.','Product designer','Tai Po','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/12.webp','["/profiles/12.webp"]'),
(13,30,'woman','feminine','An architect with an untidy desk and a carefully organised spice drawer. I enjoy a challenging hike, a silly comedy, and asking how things are made. My ideal Sunday has room for both a long walk and doing absolutely nothing.','Architect','Central','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/13.webp','["/profiles/13.webp"]'),
(14,22,'woman','feminine','I joined a pottery class for one evening and somehow stayed for a year. When I am not making slightly uneven bowls, I write software and explore new cycling routes. Looking for someone to share experiments and excellent snacks.','Software engineer','Sheung Wan','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/14.webp','["/profiles/14.webp"]'),
(15,29,'woman','feminine','You will find me reading on the tram, trying a new dance class, or making breakfast for far too many people. I like thoughtful questions and spontaneous plans, especially when the spontaneous plan involves noodles.','Event coordinator','Wan Chai','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/15.webp','["/profiles/15.webp"]'),
(16,21,'woman','feminine','I love the moment a difficult puzzle finally clicks. Outside the lab I collect recipes, watch old films, and practice swimming without swallowing half the pool. Curious minds and a gentle sense of humour are my favourite combination.','Research scientist','Causeway Bay','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/16.webp','["/profiles/16.webp"]'),
(17,28,'woman','feminine','My weekends alternate between trail dust and flour-covered countertops. I work in publishing and will definitely ask what you are reading. I am looking for the sort of company that makes even a supermarket trip feel like an outing.','Publishing editor','Kennedy Town','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/17.webp','["/profiles/17.webp"]'),
(18,35,'woman','feminine','A beginner drummer with excellent enthusiasm and questionable timing. I enjoy making things, taking ferry rides, and finding a quiet corner in a busy neighbourhood. I value people who listen closely and laugh easily.','Graphic designer','Sai Ying Pun','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/18.webp','["/profiles/18.webp"]'),
(19,27,'woman','feminine','I photograph little details: crooked signs, morning shadows, an excellent sandwich. My other interests include badminton and novels with unreliable narrators. I would love to meet someone who is happy to put their phone away for dinner.','Photographer','Mong Kok','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/19.webp','["/profiles/19.webp"]'),
(20,34,'woman','feminine','By day I help people understand numbers; by night I am usually trying to understand a sewing pattern. I enjoy live music, climbing, and properly slow breakfasts. My ideal companion is curious, warm, and willing to taste an experiment.','Data analyst','Tsim Sha Tsui','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/20.webp','["/profiles/20.webp"]'),
(21,26,'woman','feminine','I have a small collection of plants with very dramatic personalities. I work in education, enjoy long bike rides, and can talk about film soundtracks for an unreasonable time. Tell me something you recently changed your mind about.','Teacher','Sha Tin','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/21.webp','["/profiles/21.webp"]'),
(22,33,'nonbinary','feminine','Most of my travel souvenirs are ingredients. I enjoy language classes, contemporary dance, and friendly board-game rivalry. A good weekend includes something new to learn and something familiar to come home to.','Translator','Tsuen Wan','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/22.webp','["/profiles/22.webp"]'),
(23,25,'woman','feminine','I turn complex ideas into simple drawings for work. Away from my desk, I am learning tennis and slowly cooking my way through a handwritten family recipe book. I like good questions more than perfect answers.','Information designer','Tseung Kwan O','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/23.webp','["/profiles/23.webp"]'),
(24,32,'woman','feminine','A dawn swim is my favourite reset, although convincing myself to get out of bed remains difficult. I love ceramics, science fiction, and cooking for a small table of friends. Looking for easy conversation and a little adventure.','Marine researcher','Tai Po','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/24.webp','["/profiles/24.webp"]'),
(25,24,'woman','feminine','I restore old furniture badly enough to keep learning. Other joys include independent films, spicy food, and walks that end somewhere unexpected. I work in healthcare and appreciate people who are kind when nobody is watching.','Physiotherapist','Central','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/25.webp','["/profiles/25.webp"]'),
(26,31,'woman','feminine','An editor with a soft spot for terrible puns and excellent bread. I practice yoga, enjoy quiet museums, and occasionally disappear into a strategy game. The best dates leave us with a new place we want to revisit.','Editor','Sheung Wan','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/26.webp','["/profiles/26.webp"]'),
(27,23,'woman','feminine','I can identify more bird calls than dance moves, but I am working on both. I love outdoor mornings and indoor movie marathons. My job involves planning; my favourite memories tend to involve abandoning the plan.','Operations planner','Wan Chai','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/27.webp','["/profiles/27.webp"]'),
(28,30,'woman','feminine','I build little electronic projects and bake unnecessarily elaborate birthday cakes. Climbing, jazz, and second-hand bookshops fill the gaps. I would love someone to join me for the sort of afternoon that accidentally turns into dinner.','Software engineer','Causeway Bay','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/28.webp','["/profiles/28.webp"]'),
(29,22,'woman','feminine','Cooking is how I decompress after a day of design work. I am also learning photography and rediscovering badminton. I like people who have a favourite local place and a good story about how they found it.','Designer','Kennedy Town','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/29.webp','["/profiles/29.webp"]'),
(30,29,'woman','feminine','A librarian who likes noisy gigs: people contain multitudes. My weekends might involve a steep trail or a deeply competitive card game. I am looking for mutual curiosity and someone who remembers to pack water.','Librarian','Sai Ying Pun','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/30.webp','["/profiles/30.webp"]'),
(31,21,'woman','feminine','I write for work and draw for nobody in particular. My current projects include a balcony garden and mastering a decent serve. Coffee, thoughtful conversation, and a walk along the water are a very good start.','Writer','Mong Kok','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/31.webp','["/profiles/31.webp"]'),
(32,28,'woman','feminine','I enjoy the teamwork of cooking a meal together and the tiny suspense of opening the oven. Away from the kitchen I cycle, read history, and see live theatre. Looking for someone who is comfortable being a beginner.','Chef','Tsim Sha Tsui','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/32.webp','["/profiles/32.webp"]'),
(33,35,'nonbinary','feminine','I spend workdays solving practical problems and evenings making impractical pottery. There is usually a jazz record playing while I cook. I love a good hike, but I also believe staying in can be an excellent plan.','Ceramic artist','Sha Tin','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/33.webp','["/profiles/33.webp"]'),
(34,27,'woman','feminine','A curious home cook, enthusiastic cyclist, and unapologetic fan of animated films. My job is serious enough; I like my evenings to include a little play. Tell me the small thing that made your week better.','Animation editor','Tsuen Wan','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/34.webp','["/profiles/34.webp"]'),
(35,34,'man','masculine','My camera roll is equal parts street scenes and failed bread experiments. I work in engineering, love dancing, and am learning to play piano. Looking for someone who enjoys both making a plan and changing it.','Engineer','Tseung Kwan O','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/35.webp','["/profiles/35.webp"]'),
(36,26,'man','masculine','I help organise exhibitions and have surprisingly strong feelings about hiking socks. Weekends are for slow coffees, long walks, and cooking something I have never made before. I value honest conversation and a generous sense of humour.','Exhibition curator','Tai Po','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/36.webp','["/profiles/36.webp"]'),
(37,33,'man','masculine','A software developer who is happiest away from a screen after work. I love swimming, live theatre, and learning recipes from friends. My current ambition is to host a dinner where everything is ready at the same time.','Software developer','Central','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/37.webp','["/profiles/37.webp"]'),
(38,25,'man','masculine','I keep a notebook of overheard phrases and restaurants to revisit. Outside work I run, watch documentaries, and play guitar with more confidence than skill. I am interested in people who notice small things.','Journalist','Sheung Wan','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/38.webp','["/profiles/38.webp"]'),
(39,32,'man','masculine','An accountant, amateur dancer, and enthusiastic collector of museum postcards. I like a weekend that includes a good meal and a little fresh air. Looking for someone with their own interests and room to share a few.','Accountant','Wan Chai','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/39.webp','["/profiles/39.webp"]'),
(40,24,'man','masculine','I make coffee with too much precision and cook with almost none. I enjoy graphic novels, badminton, and live music in small rooms. My favourite conversations start with a simple question and end somewhere completely unexpected.','Barista','Causeway Bay','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/40.webp','["/profiles/40.webp"]'),
(41,31,'man','masculine','Climbing has made me surprisingly comfortable with not succeeding immediately. I also enjoy pottery, historical novels, and teaching friends my favourite card games. I would love to find someone who is willing to learn something together.','Researcher','Kennedy Town','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/41.webp','["/profiles/41.webp"]'),
(42,23,'man','masculine','I work in film, but my favourite evenings are often very ordinary: dinner, a walk, and a good story. I grow herbs, play tennis, and take unnecessary ferry trips. Looking for warmth, wit, and shared curiosity.','Film producer','Sai Ying Pun','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/42.webp','["/profiles/42.webp"]'),
(43,30,'man','masculine','A researcher with an excellent dumpling-folding technique and a terrible sense of direction. I love dancing, independent bookshops, and exploring new neighbourhoods. Getting a little lost usually improves the afternoon.','Researcher','Mong Kok','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/43.webp','["/profiles/43.webp"]'),
(44,22,'nonbinary','masculine','I am learning the drums and apologising to my neighbours in baked goods. My other hobbies are hiking, photography, and making elaborate playlists for short journeys. I like people who are enthusiastic about something unexpected.','Sound designer','Tsim Sha Tsui','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/44.webp','["/profiles/44.webp"]'),
(45,29,'man','masculine','My weekends involve some combination of cycling, cooking, and losing at chess. I design packaging and enjoy noticing how everyday things work. An ideal first date is simple enough that we can actually hear each other.','Packaging designer','Sha Tin','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/45.webp','["/profiles/45.webp"]'),
(46,21,'man','masculine','I collect used cookbooks with handwritten notes in the margins. When I am not in the kitchen, I play basketball, watch old films, and volunteer at a community garden. I value consistency, kindness, and good questions.','Community coordinator','Tsuen Wan','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/46.webp','["/profiles/46.webp"]'),
(47,28,'man','masculine','I work with sound and enjoy silence more than you might expect. I am happiest swimming, drawing, or reading on a quiet ferry. Looking for someone who appreciates both a lively dinner and a comfortable pause.','Sound engineer','Tseung Kwan O','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/47.webp','["/profiles/47.webp"]'),
(48,35,'man','masculine','A designer who loves spreadsheets and a runner who loves dessert. I spend Sundays experimenting with film photography or trying a new board game. I am drawn to people who make space for different perspectives.','Designer','Tai Po','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/48.webp','["/profiles/48.webp"]'),
(49,27,'man','masculine','There is always a puzzle on my table and something fermenting in my kitchen. I enjoy hiking, theatre, and learning languages badly but enthusiastically. I would love a companion for small adventures and long conversations.','Translator','Central','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/49.webp','["/profiles/49.webp"]'),
(50,34,'man','masculine','I teach music and have recently become a very earnest beginner gardener. I love science fiction, cooking with friends, and cycling before the streets get busy. Tell me about something you could happily spend an afternoon learning.','Music teacher','Sheung Wan','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/50.webp','["/profiles/50.webp"]'),
(51,26,'man','masculine','I work in urban planning and notice benches more than is normal. Outside work I dance, bake, and play cooperative games. Looking for someone who finds delight in little discoveries and does not mind taking the scenic route.','Urban planner','Wan Chai','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/51.webp','["/profiles/51.webp"]'),
(52,33,'man','masculine','A legal researcher with a weakness for arcade games and spicy noodles. I enjoy photography, weekend swims, and attempting complicated recipes on a Tuesday. My favourite people are thoughtful without taking themselves too seriously.','Legal researcher','Causeway Bay','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/52.webp','["/profiles/52.webp"]'),
(53,25,'man','masculine','I like building things, whether that means a small bookshelf or a meal from whatever is left in the fridge. I play piano, climb, and watch documentaries. Looking for a connection that feels easy without being predictable.','Furniture maker','Kennedy Town','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/53.webp','["/profiles/53.webp"]'),
(54,32,'man','masculine','My job involves colour, my wardrobe mostly does not. I enjoy drawing, long-distance walks, and quiet cinema afternoons. I would love to meet someone who has a favourite question and is happy to hear a long answer.','Colour consultant','Sai Ying Pun','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/54.webp','["/profiles/54.webp"]'),
(55,24,'nonbinary','masculine','I write software, dance salsa, and take board-game rules a little too seriously before remembering we are here for fun. I love cooking for friends and finding new swimming spots. Looking for shared laughter and independent interests.','Software developer','Mong Kok','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/55.webp','["/profiles/55.webp"]'),
(56,31,'man','masculine','I enjoy the patience of film photography and the impatience of a good basketball game. I work in education and spend weekends exploring markets or reading. A walk with no particular destination is an underrated first date.','Teacher','Tsim Sha Tsui','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/56.webp','["/profiles/56.webp"]'),
(57,23,'man','masculine','An enthusiastic baker who has finally learned to weigh ingredients. I love jazz, cycling, and the kind of museum where one small exhibit changes your afternoon. Looking for someone who asks follow-up questions.','Baker','Sha Tin','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/57.webp','["/profiles/57.webp"]'),
(58,30,'man','masculine','I keep starting books about subjects I know nothing about. My spare time goes to tennis, ceramics, and trying new noodle shops. I appreciate people who can make an ordinary evening feel like time well spent.','Librarian','Tsuen Wan','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/58.webp','["/profiles/58.webp"]'),
(59,22,'man','masculine','I am a nurse, a casual gamer, and a dedicated maker of Sunday breakfast. I enjoy photography and getting out onto a trail when schedules allow. Looking for mutual kindness and someone who values a quiet evening together.','Nurse','Tseung Kwan O','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/59.webp','["/profiles/59.webp"]'),
(60,29,'man','masculine','My favourite kind of travel involves learning a recipe and missing the planned train. Closer to home I cycle, read, and go to small gigs. I like good conversation and people who are comfortable changing their minds.','Travel editor','Tai Po','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/60.webp','["/profiles/60.webp"]'),
(61,21,'man','masculine','I work in animation and am still delighted by a well-made paper airplane. I enjoy climbing, cooking, and wandering through galleries. An ideal weekend has room for both an ambitious project and a very long lunch.','Animator','Central','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/61.webp','["/profiles/61.webp"]'),
(62,28,'man','masculine','A product researcher with a habit of asking one more question. I love badminton, old records, and cooking dishes that require a whole afternoon. Looking for someone who appreciates thoughtful effort and spontaneous silliness.','Product researcher','Sheung Wan','Creative','Outgoing','/profiles/62.webp','["/profiles/62.webp"]'),
(63,35,'man','masculine','I make furniture, play piano, and have an ambitious but mostly theoretical reading list. I enjoy hikes that end with a good meal and films that leave something to discuss. Tell me about a place you keep returning to.','Furniture maker','Wan Chai','Cozy','Quiet','/profiles/63.webp','["/profiles/63.webp"]'),
(64,27,'man','masculine','I love the collaboration of a shared kitchen and the friendly competition of a board game. I work in science, take dance classes, and photograph the harbour. Looking for a thoughtful person with a little mischief in them.','Research scientist','Causeway Bay','Adventure','Balanced','/profiles/64.webp','["/profiles/64.webp"]');
